<title>SINGAPORE: SM Summit gets SES nod for bonus issue.</title>
<headline>SM Summit gets SES nod for bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment firm SM Summit Holdings Ltd said on Thursday the stock exchange has granted in-principle approved for its proposed bonus issue of one ordinary share for every four existing shares held.</p>
<p>The bonus issue would total 37.5 million new ordinary shares.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
